#==== Store Listing ====

@store_listing

Restyle any website. Point at something on the page and change it, or describe what you want and the Stylebot agent writes the CSS. Your style loads every time you come back.

★ Pick and style: click any element and change its font, colors, spacing and more, without writing code
★ Code editor: write any CSS by hand
★ Stylebot agent: describe a change, from a small fix to a whole new theme, and it writes the CSS. Bring your own Claude, OpenAI or Gemini key
★ Sync: keep your styles in sync across computers with Google Drive
★ Version history: every change is kept, so you can restore any earlier version
★ Profiles: keep several looks for a site and switch between them
★ Readability: turn articles into a clean, distraction-free reading view

Free and open source since 2011.

Homepage: https://stylebot.dev/
Bug reports and feature requests: https://github.com/ankit/stylebot/issues

@privacy_policy

Privacy Policy:

Stylebot does not collect any personal data or browsing history, and has no server. It asks for access to websites so it can apply your styles when you visit them.

Your styles are stored in your browser. If you turn on sync, they are saved to a file in your own Google Drive that only Stylebot can see.

If you use the Stylebot agent, your messages, the page's structure and styles, and any screenshot you attach are sent directly from your browser to the AI provider you choose (Anthropic, OpenAI or Google), using your own API key. Your key is stored only on your computer.

